  "details": "Likely due to EAC's setup, playing on a remote machine results in the game saying it doesn't support streaming.\n\nAdditionally, when connecting to a desktop via the steam link settings to view the entire desktop, vrchat refuses to render if focused, but will render just fine when not. Input works perfectly, but it renders blank.\n\nThis is not an issue in parsec and the like. This also doesn't affect steam link for VR use.\n\nScreenshots in order:\n\n- Launching via \"Stream\" or \"Connect\" from another machine\n\n- Steam connected to the desktop, vrchat unfocused\n\n- Steam connected to the desktop, vrchat focused (smudging is due to me resizing the window)\n\n- Parsec connected to the desktop, vrchat focused",
